//CTP Editor Structure file
//For more detailed comments see advance.ces

0.3 //Version number

#%047%047	//Comment charachter in data file
%032%009	//Delimiter charachters in data file
		// (use %nnn for ASCII ref)
:		//Break on right quasi-delimiter
}{		//Break on left quasi-delimiter

1 //Format

t //Whether this has a number at the top (num of entries)
f //Whether this has a tree structure
t //Whether this file references GL entries
t //Whether this file has entries in gl_str.txt
f //Whether the entries have an article
f //Whether this file is the GL icon file
f //Whether this structure file describes formatting of fields
  // (i.e. whether it has the LBF and LAF columns below)

//Name			Comp	PByDef	AMult	NumArgs
	//Type		DefaultValue	Comment
CONCEPT_DEFAULT_ICON	t	t	f	1
	uniticon.ces	ICON_%n		Icon ID. Must be a valid Icon ID from UnitIcon.txt 
@ //End of fields

CONCEPT_DEFAULT_ICON  //The field which references the GL icon entry in uniticon.txt
DATABASE_CONCEPTS //Name of database for GL hyperlinks
CONCEPT_  //The prefix which identifies this file in gl_str.txt
